CalldataSliceLib::sliceAddress
├── given valid address at start
│   ├── it should return correct address
│   └── it should return offset + 20
├── given address at offset
│   ├── it should read from correct position
│   └── it should return offset + 20
├── given address followed by trailing data
│   └── it should not include trailing bytes in result
└── given sequential address reads
    └── it should read each address correctly with advancing offset